@李振民 你看下是不是渲染的问题","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T02:41:55.289Z","message.seq":1587,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@浩澜 这个 session 的 自动化执行id能查到么","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T03:07:07.6Z","message.seq":1588,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@公台 https://pre-ai.saas-admin.org/ai/agent-trace?entity_id=automation-run:aur_a8ae020221a935dbb50127b7&page=1&run_id=bar_b363df0f8d2a48348e2d751283ac247e","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T03:12:14.203Z","message.seq":1590,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qluqoynfcv"}},{"message.content":"预发包有AI的全部功能吗@李振民","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T07:26:42.81Z","message.seq":2178,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxa3mbkp"}},{"message.content":"对了，任务空间的自定义字段对 AI 助手会有什么影响吗？ AI 助手能按照自定义字段筛选任务吗？","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T07:29:12.151Z","message.seq":2183,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"@浩澜 行，这样也可以。我后续再看看任务空间的新功能 AI 助手咋支持","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T07:34:18.508Z","message.seq":2186,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"我 test 环境没有 AI 助手的入口，谁能给我开一下？","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T07:57:23.723Z","message.seq":2188,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"@SuChen 现在PRE有一个JIRA和iHive数据同步的测试项目，里面应用了自定义字段功能。你要是有高管权限可以往这个项目里加上产品同事，我把每个需求的产品经理信息也同步过来。","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:30:18.784Z","message.seq":2193,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"后面也可以用这个项目里的真实数据测试AI助手的功能。","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:32:31.62Z","message.seq":2194,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"@守白 你用 API 创建的吧？你试试用 AI 助手的写入功能创建项目和任务看看？好用不","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:40:59.474Z","message.seq":2201,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"@SuChen 对，因为现在还没openAPI所以先用我自己的token和现在空间任务的http接口，这周自定义字段上线完我是想试一下基于这个项目的数据自动生成一些报告给士衡。之前用的JIRA的AI助手","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:48:09.596Z","message.seq":2203,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"@守白 晚上禁用了自动化","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T01:43:56.576Z","message.seq":2209,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qluqoynfcv"}},{"message.content":"￼
线上环境，周末+晚上都停用自动化了的","message.content_type":"quote_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T01:46:11.051Z","message.seq":2210,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qluqoynfcv"}},{"message.content":"@陈理仕 swarm环境，有“ai助手权限”控制吗（管理台以及对应的查询接口）","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T03:52:21.124Z","message.seq":2213,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvgomnvjyywac"}},{"message.content":"我用 AI 创建完任务之后，不能立即在任务列表里看到，目前是怎么个刷新机制？","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:23:09.892Z","message.seq":2214,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"嗯嗯 我开始还以为写入那个需求不支持：） 那还得等等，我先把数据同步搞好","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:55:32.563Z","message.seq":2231,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"做个小迭代吧，可以比 AI 助手一期晚1-2个版本再上线，@Lexia 你负责","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:56:38.673Z","message.seq":2234,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"AI 助手支持自定义字段，读和写都支持，不过不急，11 月中旬之前出方案就行","message.content_type":"quote_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:57:43.48Z","message.seq":2236,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"另外感觉咱们AI助手现在比较依赖提示词，如果老板AI用的不熟练可能召回的质量就浮动比较大，这块JIRA的Revo是用很多个子skill实现效果提升的，如果不确定的可以选择具体的skill来处理，结果和预期的偏差会小一些。","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T05:01:14.353Z","message.seq":2238,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"后面可以加个自动生成skill的功能","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T05:05:37.139Z","message.seq":2244,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"现在让 AI 根据意图识别自动选择 skill 会更好，比让用户自己主动选择用哪个 skill，非重度用户也选不好","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T05:05:41.702Z","message.seq":2245,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"1、AI 新手引导功能 (测试时，记得测试 多语言下的引导)
2、上面自动化创建后 ，列表刷新问题
